OL,3,AAI boom could trigger market shocks,
OL,4,ABank of England boss warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) could
OL,7,Ftrigger financial market shocks and the
OL,8,FUK needs to be prepared for them, the
OL,9,Fgovernor of the Bank of England has
OL,10,Fwarned.
OL,12,FAndrew Bailey said the central bank is
OL,13,Fwatching the huge amounts of money
OL,14,Fbeing invested in AI "very carefully"
OL,15,Fand cautioned that "not everybody
OL,16,Falways wins".
OL,18,FThe money that has been spent on and
OL,19,Floaned to AI firms over the last few
OL,20,Fyears in the hope of large returns is
OL,21,Fcausing markets to value some of them
OL,22,Fas multi-trillion dollar businesses.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,110,105,200,160,0,100
